{"id": "1823431", "name": "מציאת בסיס לחיתוך תתי מרחבים מיוצגים על ידי span ב R^4", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "lowerEntriesWithRandom", "params": ["vals"], "body": "buildq([vals],lambda([i,j], if i<j then 0 else if i=j then rand([-1,1]) else rand(vals)))"}, {"name": "random_invertible_matrix", "params": ["n", "vals"], "body": "genmatrix (lowerEntriesWithRandom(vals), n, n).transpose(genmatrix (lowerEntriesWithRandom(vals), n, n))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>במרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span> נתונים שני תתי המרחב הבאים:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[W_1=\\text{span} \\left\\{ {{CT:0}}\\right\\},\\quad W_2=\\text{span} \\left\\{ {{CT:1}}\\right\\}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> כך ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{v\\}\\)</span> בסיס לתת המרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W_1\\cap W_2\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct: if rank(addcol(tans,ans1))=1 then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correct", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["B1", "B2", "E", "n", "tans"], "nvariants": 50}